in.com/de/ayah/12-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-100.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:100 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na akawapandisha wazazi wake kwenye kiti cha enzi. Na wote wakaporomoka kumsujudia. Na akasema: Ewe baba yangu! Hii ndiyo tafsiri ya ile ndoto yangu ya zam\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 100\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-100.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/12.html\">Sura Yusuf</a> › Aya 100</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Yusuf 12:100</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَرَفَعَ أَبَوَيْهِ عَلَى الْعَرْشِ وَخَرُّوا لَهُ سُجَّدًا وَقَالَ يَا أَبَتِ هَٰذَا تَأْوِيلُ رُؤْيَايَ مِن قَبْلُ قَدْ جَعَلَهَا رَبِّي حَقًّا وَقَدْ أَحْسَنَ بِي إِذْ أَخْرَجَنِي مِنَ السِّجْنِ وَجَاءَ بِكُم مِّنَ الْبَدْوِ مِن بَعْدِ أَن نَّزَغَ الشَّيْطَانُ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَ إِخْوَتِي إِنَّ رَبِّي لَطِيفٌ لِّمَا يَشَاءُ إِنَّهُ هُوَ الْعَلِيمُ الْحَكِيمُ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na akawapandisha wazazi wake kwenye kiti cha enzi. Na wote wakaporomoka kumsujudia. Na akasema: Ewe baba yangu! Hii ndiyo tafsiri ya ile ndoto yangu ya zamani. Na Mwenyezi Mungu ameijaalia iwe kweli. Na Mwenyezi Mungu amenifanyia wema kunitoa gerezani, na kukuleteni kutoka jangwani baada ya Shet&#x27;ani kuchochea baina yangu na ndugu zangu. Hakika Mola wangu Mlezi ni Mpole kwa alitakalo. Bila ya shaka Yeye ni Mjuzi Mwenye hikima.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمعنى الثالث أن التأويل هو الحقيقة التي يؤول الكلام إليها - وإن وافقت ظاهره -<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 5/36</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولم يقل: أخرجني من الجب، حفظا للأدب مع إخوته. وتفتيا عليهم: أن لا يخجلهم بما جرى في الجب.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/360</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقال {وجاء بكم من البدو} [يوسف: 100] ولم يقل: رفع عنكم جهد الجوع والحاجة. أدبا معهم.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/360</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأضاف ما جرى إلى السبب. ولم يضفه إلى المباشر الذي هو أقرب إليه منه. فقال: {من بعد أن نزغ الشيطان بيني وبين إخوتي} [يوسف: 100] فأعطى الفتوة والكرم والأدب حقه.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/360</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s12a100\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-99.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (12:99)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-106.html\">Aya inayofuata (12:106)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-106.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:106 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na wengi katika wao hawamuamini Mwenyezi Mungu pasina kuwa ni washirikina.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-106.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:106 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na wengi katika wao hawamuamini Mwenyezi Mungu pasina kuwa ni washirikina.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 106\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-106.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/12.html\">Sura Yusuf</a> › Aya 106</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Yusuf 12:106</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا يُؤْمِنُ أَكْثَرُهُم بِاللَّهِ إِلَّا وَهُم مُّشْرِكُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na wengi katika wao hawamuamini Mwenyezi Mungu pasina kuwa ni washirikina.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس وغيره</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «تسألهم: من خلق السماوات والأرض؟ فيقولون: الله، وهم مع ذلك يعبدون غيره»<cite>«اقتضاء الصراط المستقيم لمخالفة أصحاب الجحيم» 2/387</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s12a106\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-100.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (12:100)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-108.html\">Aya inayofuata (12:108)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-108.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:108 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sema: Hii ndiyo Njia yangu - ninalingania kwa Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kujua - mimi na wanao nifuata. Na ametakasika Mwenyezi Mungu! Wala mimi si katika washirik\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-108.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:108 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sema: Hii ndiyo Njia yangu - ninalingania kwa Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kujua - mimi na wanao nifuata. Na ametakasika Mwenyezi Mungu! Wala mimi si katika washirik\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 108\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-108.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/12.html\">Sura Yusuf</a> › Aya 108</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Yusuf 12:108</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ هَٰذِهِ سَبِيلِي أَدْعُو إِلَى اللَّهِ عَلَىٰ بَصِيرَةٍ أَنَا وَمَنِ اتَّبَعَنِي وَسُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ وَمَا أَنَا مِنَ الْمُشْرِكِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sema: Hii ndiyo Njia yangu - ninalingania kwa Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kujua - mimi na wanao nifuata. Na ametakasika Mwenyezi Mungu! Wala mimi si katika washirikina.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الدعوة إلى الله هي الدعوة إلى الإيمان به وبما جاءت به رسله بتصديقهم فيما أخبروا به وطاعتهم فيما أمروا<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/157</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي أنا وأتباعي على بصيرة.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/451</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر تعالى أن من اتبع الرسول يدعو إلى الله، ومن دعا إلى الله على بصيرة وجب اتباعه<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 4/100</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s12a108\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-106.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (12:106)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-109.html\">Aya inayofuata (12:109)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-109.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:109 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na hatukuwatuma Mitume kabla yako isipo kuwa wanaume tulio wafunulia wahyi miongoni mwa watu wa mijini. Je! Hawatembei katika ardhi wakaona jinsi ulivyo ku\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-109.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:109 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Na hatukuwatuma Mitume kabla yako isipo kuwa wanaume tulio wafunulia wahyi miongoni mwa watu wa mijini. Je! Hawatembei katika ardhi wakaona jinsi ulivyo ku\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 109\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-109.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/12.html\">Sura Yusuf</a> › Aya 109</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Yusuf 12:109</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا أَرْسَلْنَا مِن قَبْلِكَ إِلَّا رِجَالًا نُّوحِي إِلَيْهِم مِّنْ أَهْلِ الْقُرَىٰ أَفَلَمْ يَسِيرُوا فِي الْأَرْضِ فَيَنظُرُوا كَيْفَ كَانَ عَاقِبَةُ الَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ وَلَدَارُ الْآخِرَةِ خَيْرٌ لِّلَّذِينَ اتَّقَوْا أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na hatukuwatuma Mitume kabla yako isipo kuwa wanaume tulio wafunulia wahyi miongoni mwa watu wa mijini. Je! Hawatembei katika ardhi wakaona jinsi ulivyo kuwa mwisho wa walio kuwa kabla yao? Na hakika nyumba ya Akhera ni bora kwa wamchao Mungu. Basi hamfahamu?.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وذلك لأن الرسل لهم الكمال في عامة الأمور، حتى في النسب<cite>«اقتضاء الصراط المستقيم لمخالفة أصحاب الجحيم» 1/415</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا يدل على أنه لم يرسل جنيا ولا امرأة ولا بدويا<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/416</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s12a109\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-108.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (12:108)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-110.html\">Aya inayofuata (12:110)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-110.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:110 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hata Mitume walipo kata tamaa na wakaona kuwa wamekadhibishwa, hapo ikawajia nusura yetu, wakaokolewa tuwatakao. Na adhabu yetu haitowawacha kaumu ya wakos\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/12-110.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:110 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Hata Mitume walipo kata tamaa na wakaona kuwa wamekadhibishwa, hapo ikawajia nusura yetu, wakaokolewa tuwatakao. Na adhabu yetu haitowawacha kaumu ya wakos\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Yusuf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/12.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 110\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-110.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/12.html\">Sura Yusuf</a> › Aya 110</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Yusuf 12:110</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿حَتَّىٰ إِذَا اسْتَيْأَسَ الرُّسُلُ وَظَنُّوا أَنَّهُمْ قَدْ كُذِبُوا جَاءَهُمْ نَصْرُنَا فَنُجِّيَ مَن نَّشَاءُ وَلَا يُرَدُّ بَأْسُنَا عَنِ الْقَوْمِ الْمُجْرِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Hata Mitume walipo kata tamaa na wakaona kuwa wamekadhibishwa, hapo ikawajia nusura yetu, wakaokolewa tuwatakao. Na adhabu yetu haitowawacha kaumu ya wakosefu.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكن القراءة الأخرى ثابتة لا يمكن إنكارها وقد تأولها ابن عباس وظاهر الكلام معه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والظن لا يراد به في الكتاب والسنة الاعتقاد الراجح كما هو في اصطلاح طائفة من أهل الكلام<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عائشة (قراءة التثقيل: كُذِّبوا)</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «معاذ الله والله ما وعد الله رسوله من شيء قط إلا علم أنه كائن قبل أن يكون؛ ولكن لم يزل البلاء بالرسل حتى ظنوا وخافوا أن يكون من معهم يكذبهم»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/176</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلما ذكر أن الرسل هم الذين استيأسوا كان فيه دليل على أنهم دخل قلوبهم يأس من غير يقين استيقنوه؛ لأن اليقين في ذلك إنما يأتيهم من عند الله<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 5/586</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s12a110\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-109.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (12:109)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/12-111.html\">Aya inayofuata (12:111)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/12-111.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Yusuf 12:111 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kwa hakika katika hadithi zao limo zingatio kwa wenye akili. Si maneno yaliyo zuliwa, bali ni ya kusadikisha yaliyo kabla yake, na ufafanuzi wa kila kitu, \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/12-111.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href